1
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,820
(Recap)

2
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,880
This is for you.

3
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:35,800
Yeah.

4
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,200
