7
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:41,280
Okay.

8
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:42,360
Don't!

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,840
Hey, don't!

10
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,080
That freaked me out.

11
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,240
I thought I got rejected.

12
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,040
I was about to jump ship.

13
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,880
How could you get rejected?

14
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,960
How could you get rejected?

15
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,160
A message just came in.

16
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,480
Heart-to-heart moment.

17
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,520
It's not about the answer.

18
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,240
It's about knowing how she feels.

19
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,200
That's enough for me.

20
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,520
You need time to figure out

21
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:07,720
