22
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,080
I know how I feel, and it won't change.

23
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,000
I'm not picking option C.

24
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,000
And I can't pick option A.

25
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,760
So it has to be option B.

26
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:14,040
This is so hard.

27
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:17,020
♪Don't stay trapped inside your room♪

28
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:18,420
♪Outside the window,
the rain has cleared♪

29
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:19,700
♪Set reality aside♪

30
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:21,020
♪Follow your heart♪

31
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:22,380
♪What you've been longing
for is right ahead♪

32
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:23,860
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

33
00:01:23,860 --> 00:01:26,740
♪Just be a little braver♪

34
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:29,500
♪Come closer, come closer♪

35
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,580
♪There's a little spark
shining in your eyes♪

36
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:34,700
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

37
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:38,420
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

38
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:42,660
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=

39
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:43,900
(Time to choose)

40
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,320
Here we go, guys.

41
00:01:45,380 --> 00:01:46,820
