46
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,840
(I know how I feel, and it won't change)
Option A is red,

47
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,760
(I want to keep getting to know them)
option B is blue,

48
00:01:58,040 --> 00:02:00,160
