and option C is multicolor.

49
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:10,460
(I know how I feel, and it won't change)

50
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:12,080
(I want us to be a couple)
Pick red,

51
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,280
