Okay, red first.

82
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,520
Cao Yiheng.

83
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,360
And Cui Kaiyi.

84
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,080
Cao Yiheng.

85
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:14,820
