Okay.

111
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,160
Chen Hewen?

112
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,680
Option B.

113
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,800
Chen Hewen, option B.

114
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,580
(Blue ticket: Chen Hewen)

115
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,560
