116
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:50,220
(Blue ticket: Sha Yue'er)

117
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,680
Meng, option C.

118
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,440
Okay. Meng, option C.

119
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:53,660
