125
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,520
Sun Bohan still goes for it?

126
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,800
I think he will.

127
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,440
I think Sun Bohan

128
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:05,160
