143
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,160
Sold?

144
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,360
I'm sold.

145
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,000
Okay.

146
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:24,940
