195
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:36,740
(Heart-to-heart moment)

196
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,440
Here we go.

197
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,200
I'm so nervous.

198
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,120
Cui Kaiyi looks stunning.

199
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,120
Meng.

200
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,000
She looks so pretty.

201
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,360
So handsome.

202
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,840
Liang Xiaoyu.

203
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,870
So pretty.

204
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,400
Yu Yang looks handsome.

205
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,640
Here we go.

206
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,760
I can't wait to see what happens.

207
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,480
So pretty.

208
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:55,160
Yu Yang.

209
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,840
(Holding our breath)
So nervous.

210
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,000
They must be freaking out.

211
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,400
Here we go.

212
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:35,320
Fang looks like a princess.
She's so pretty.

213
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:41,160
Hello?

214
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,720
Hello.

215
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,640
Hi.

216
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,400
Hello,

217
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,880
Renfang.

218
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,680
Hello, Yu Yang.

219
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,080
It's me, Yu Yang.

220
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,520
Oh my God.

221
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,040
These two...

222
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,840
These two are so cute.

223
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,720
Hello, Yu Yang.

224
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,560
Hello.

225
00:07:57,760 --> 00:08:00,080
I have so much I want to tell you.

226
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:01,920
Yeah.

227
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,920
And...

228
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:05,920
I never thought

229
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,440
