237
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:39,200
Actually, I...

238
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,160
It's okay. Don't be nervous.

239
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,680
Most people

240
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:51,800
