246
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,060
(Imitating her)

247
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,760
Every moment with you

248
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:23,840
keeps replaying in my head

249
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,000
