250
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,200
And maybe your voice

251
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:30,800
is the voice-over to it all.

252
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,040
Okay, that's enough.

253
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,480
That's the moment.

254
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,600
Best compliment?

255
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,680
An empty plate.

256
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,680
This mapo tofu is insane.

257
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,120
It feels like home.

258
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,480
Perfect sunset.

259
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:54,880
Perfect BBQ.

260
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,560
This is actually

261
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,840
