266
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,400
Not at all.

267
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,840
You're doing pretty well right now.

268
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:15,820
(We're like two wandering notes)

269
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:17,580
(that somehow found one another)

270
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,680
