271
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,680
Three, two, one.

272
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:22,620
(Thank you for seeing me)

273
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:23,800
I'll take one for you guys.

274
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,780
(For seeing the innocence in my music,)

275
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:27,980
(the honesty in every melody,)

276
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:30,380
(and for choosing to come closer to me)

277
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,520
My hand is tiny.

278
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,560
How tiny?

279
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:36,980
(I hope we write our own song,)

280
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:39,940
(one that always feels like sunshine)

281
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,720
This is so sweet.

282
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,600
It all

283
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,120
went by so fast.

284
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,280
Standing here,

285
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:57,920
I feel like I'm back on day one,

286
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,280
