00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:43,280
You want to chat?

876
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,280
That's fine. We can...

877
00:36:44,280 --> 00:36:45,320
You want to chat?

878
00:36:45,320 --> 00:36:46,920
that's fine. Tomorrow...

879
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,400
You can rest if you want.

880
00:36:50,240 --> 00:36:51,080
Tomorrow.

881
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:53,920
Love really can change you.

882
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:55,180
(Light falls on the flower,
and the flower turns toward it)

883
00:36:55,180 --> 00:36:56,220
(We bring out the best in each other)

884
00:36:56,240 --> 00:36:57,280
She spun around.

885
00:36:59,720 --> 00:37:01,040
It felt really special.

886
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:03,240
I think I'll remember it forever.

887
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:07,040
I was actually worried

888
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,520
it might be too late...

889
00:37:10,200 --> 00:37:11,640
and I'd interrupt your rest.

890
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:13,880
Of course not.

891
00:37:16,560 --> 00:37:17,920
That was the first time I realized

892
00:37:17,920 --> 00:37:18,880
someone coming closer

893
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:21,040
could feel so moving.

894
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:27,600
You made me feel really safe.

895
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,040
Any doubts

896
00:37:29,040 --> 00:37:30,480
I had back then

897
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:31,960
just completely

898
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:32,960
disappeared.

899
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:34,320
After that,

900
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:35,560
every time I saw you,

901
00:37:35,560 --> 00:37:36,480
I felt like

902
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,520
you only had eyes for me.

903
00:37:38,520 --> 00:37:39,520
The things you did

904
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:41,640
always made me feel

905
00:37:43,080 --> 00:37:43,920
that in your heart,

906
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:45,520
I mattered a lot

907
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:46,600
and I was special.

908
00:37:48,120 --> 00:37:49,400
Let yourself hang for a second.

909
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:50,320
Get a feel for it.

910
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:51,600
Then put your left foot back on.

911
00:37:51,600 --> 00:37:52,280
It's okay.

912
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,560
(His quiet care on their first date)
I've got you.

913
00:37:53,560 --> 00:37:55,840
I happened to bring some ingredients

914
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,600
from Tianjin tonight

915
00:37:57,600 --> 00:37:58,640
to make...

916
00:37:58,640 --> 00:37:59,680
Eight Treasure tofu.

917
00:37:59,680 --> 00:38:00,960
No problem.

918
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,000
Smells so good.

919
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:05,200
What's this?

920
00:38:05,560 --> 00:38:06,600
Eight Treasure tofu.

921
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:08,100
(Every promise will be kept)

922
00:38:10,760 --> 00:38:12,040
It's not cut. Why put on a Band-Aid?

923
00:38:12,040 --> 00:38:12,880
Let me see.

924
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,120
It's not cut.

925
00:38:14,120 --> 00:38:15,160
(Checks)
It really isn't.

926
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:17,520
I'm fine.

927
00:38:17,840 --> 00:38:18,920
How about you put on

928
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:19,480
my shirt first?

929
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,400
If the AC keeps blowing on you,

930
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:22,960
(Worried she'll get cold)
it might get worse.

931
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,520
Okay, I'll put it on.

932
00:38:26,180 --> 00:38:27,940
(Rolls up the sleeves)

933
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,040
Put this on first.

934
00:38:29,040 --> 00:38:30,880
And keep it off your dress.

935
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,800
It's these little things
that really get you.

936
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:33,280
Yeah.

937
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:33,960
See? Like this.

938
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:36,140
(His thoughtful care, time after time)
Doesn't it feel less wet now?

939
00:38:37,240 --> 00:38:38,920
Why "little sun"?

940
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,320
Because

941
00:38:40,680 --> 00:38:42,120
sunflowers

942
00:38:42,120 --> 00:38:43,560
always turn toward the little sun.

943
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,800
His own sun.

944
00:38:52,040 --> 00:38:53,520
You're veering off.

945
00:38:58,900 --> 00:39:00,620
(Sunflowers will always
turn toward the sun)

946
00:39:00,640 --> 00:39:02,680
(I'll always run toward you)
Someone will always choose you.

947
00:39:19,680 --> 00:39:20,600
You told me

948
00:39:20,600 --> 00:39:23,280
there was no one else
you wanted to get to know,

949
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:25,000
and that you're very devoted.

950
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:27,600
I've always remembered that.

951
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:29,480
I feel like

952
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,280
you didn't just say it back then.

953
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:32,400
You really

954
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,160
kept showing it through your actions.

955
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:35,080
It made me feel

956
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:37,160
truly chosen.

957
00:39:37,160 --> 00:39:38,320
And that's

958
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:40,160
such a wonderful feeling.

959
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:45,320
Love makes us both braver.

960
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:46,480
Yeah.

961
00:39:50,440 --> 00:39:52,560
So on this call today,

962
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:54,880
I really want to tell you sincerely,

963
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:56,240
Cao Yiheng, I like you.

964
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:58,480
(Cao Yiheng, I like you)
So sweet.

965
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,480
Sunflower.

966
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:07,640
Can I come find you now?

967
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:09,840
I'm not done yet.

968
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:12,320
Okay.

969
00:40:13,320 --> 00:40:15,520
You took me
to my graduation exam before.

970
00:40:15,520 --> 00:40:17,440
I feel like my life

971
00:40:17,440 --> 00:40:19,880
is entering a new chapter now.

972
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:22,400
So I want to formally

973
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:23,480
ask you something.

974
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,640
Can I

975
00:40:24,640 --> 00:40:25,440
invite you

976
00:40:25,440 --> 00:40:26,440
to join me

977
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:28,120
on

978
00:40:28,120 --> 00:40:30,000
the next part of our journey?

979
00:40:30,640 --> 00:40:31,520
Will you?

980
00:40:31,520 --> 00:40:33,100
(Will you join me
on the next part of my journey?)

981
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:34,680
Will you?

982
00:40:39,520 --> 00:40:40,680
Of course I will.

983
00:40:40,680 --> 00:40:42,400
I've been waiting for this too.

984
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:43,760
(Of course I will.
I've been waiting for this too)

985
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:51,080
Then right now,

986
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:53,120
I'm waiting for you by a cabin.

987
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:53,920
If you want to,

988
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:55,280
come meet me.

989
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:57,920
Which cabin are you by?

990
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:59,640
There are so many cabins here.

991
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:03,920
Then come find me. Bye.

992
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,080
Okay.

993
00:41:08,180 --> 00:41:10,060
(Wipes away tears)

994
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:15,920
Go!

995
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,680
He always runs to see her.

996
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:24,700
Oh my gosh.

997
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:26,160
This feels like a romance drama.

998
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:41,040
I have a gift for you too.

999
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:42,680
What's wrong?

1000
00:41:42,680 --> 00:41:43,720
My pants are too loose.

1001
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:48,120
Then let's exchange.

1002
00:41:48,120 --> 00:41:48,760
Okay.

1003
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:49,480
Flowers first.

1004
00:41:49,720 --> 00:41:50,960
This is for you.

1005
00:41:51,200 --> 00:41:52,120
Sunflowers.

1006
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:54,000
Sunflowers.

1007
00:41:54,840 --> 00:41:55,880
It's heavy.

1008
00:41:55,880 --> 00:41:57,200
Of course.

1009
00:41:58,660 --> 00:41:59,580
(Catches his breath)

1010
00:41:59,720 --> 00:42:01,360
Did you run here?

1011
00:42:01,980 --> 00:42:03,180
(Flustered)

1012
00:42:03,200 --> 00:42:04,080
Yeah.

1013
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:07,420
Wait, let me put the flowers down.

1014
00:42:07,420 --> 00:42:08,300
(Laughs)

1015
00:42:09,220 --> 00:42:10,740
(Sets them down)

1016
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,520
I'll put them here.

1017
00:42:12,960 --> 00:42:14,440
This is my gift for you.

1018
00:42:14,920 --> 00:42:16,080
And there's a letter.

1019
00:42:16,600 --> 00:42:17,680
You too?

1020
00:42:17,940 --> 00:42:19,620
(Exchange gifts)
Let me show you first.

1021
00:42:20,400 --> 00:42:21,440
What is it?

1022
00:42:23,080 --> 00:42:23,840
Take a guess.

1023
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:24,240
Feel the weight.

1024
00:42:24,240 --> 00:42:24,760
Guess?

1025
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:25,720
Feel the weight.

1026
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:27,760
See if it's light or heavy.

1027
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:29,880
What is this?

1028
00:42:33,160 --> 00:42:34,400
Well? Do you like it?

1029
00:42:34,540 --> 00:42:36,820
(Cui Kaiyi's confession gift
for Cao Yiheng)

1030
00:42:38,720 --> 00:42:40,520
From now on,

1031
00:42:41,160 --> 00:42:42,720
whenever I see you,

1032
00:42:42,720 --> 00:42:44,460
(I'll wear it every time I see you)
I'll wear it.

1033
00:42:45,200 --> 00:42:46,520
Okay.

1034
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:55,840
Let me see.

1035
00:42:59,120 --> 00:42:59,840
Why?

1036
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:01,280
Why a watch?

1037
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:03,320
It's so pretty.

1038
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:05,120
Because I looked it up,

1039
00:43:05,120 --> 00:43:07,840
and nursing students
can't wear much jewelry.

1040
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:09,360
Look how thoughtful he is.

1041
00:43:09,960 --> 00:43:10,560
That's true.

1042
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:11,400
And then,

1043
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:13,200
when you're busy,

1044
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:15,960
you can look at your watch.

1045
00:43:17,040 --> 00:43:19,120
While you're checking the time,

1046
00:43:19,120 --> 00:43:21,200
when you see it,

1047
00:43:21,200 --> 00:43:22,200
you can think of me.

1048
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:25,480
I'd think of you even without it.

1049
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:29,060
(I'd think of you even without it)

1050
00:43:34,240 --> 00:43:34,880
So, should we...

1051
00:43:36,640 --> 00:43:37,320
Should we...

1052
00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:40,560
I'll go...

1053
00:43:40,560 --> 00:43:41,480
Who's reading first?

1054
00:43:42,040 --> 00:43:42,960
I'll go first.

1055
00:43:42,960 --> 00:43:44,000
You go first.

1056
00:43:44,520 --> 00:43:45,480
So formal.

1057
00:43:46,400 --> 00:43:48,320
Isn't this what people do at weddings?

1058
00:43:55,800 --> 00:43:57,600
Hello, Cui Kaiyi.

1059
00:43:58,080 --> 00:43:58,920
Hello.

1060
00:44:00,280 --> 00:44:02,000
So cute.

1061
00:44:02,000 --> 00:44:03,440
As I looked back on

1062
00:44:03,440 --> 00:44:04,840
our memories from these past days,

1063
00:44:04,840 --> 00:44:06,400
I realized our feelings

1064
00:44:06,400 --> 00:44:07,160
have always been hidden

1065
00:44:07,160 --> 00:44:08,660
in the little moments of every day.

1066
00:44:08,660 --> 00:44:09,460
(Makes eye contact)

1067
00:44:19,280 --> 00:44:20,920
In our nightly texts,

1068
00:44:20,920 --> 00:44:23,080
I said what I couldn't
tell you in person.

1069
00:44:24,320 --> 00:44:26,080
Oh no, I can't take it anymore.

1070
00:44:26,960 --> 00:44:28,680
She's trying not to cry.

1071
00:44:31,560 --> 00:44:32,680
I remember everyone would often

1072
00:44:32,680 --> 00:44:34,320
gather around and chat.

1073
00:44:34,720 --> 00:44:36,320
I'd quietly sit off to the side,

1074
00:44:36,320 --> 00:44:38,120
and no one really noticed me.

1075
00:44:38,120 --> 00:44:39,240
But you always noticed

1076
00:44:39,240 --> 00:44:40,760
when I wasn't with the crowd.

1077
00:44:45,280 --> 00:44:46,720
Did you come from far away?

1078
00:44:46,720 --> 00:44:47,800
None of us came from that far.

1079
00:44:49,400 --> 00:44:50,160
Pretty far.

1080
00:44:50,160 --> 00:44:51,960
How would you introduce yourself

1081
00:44:51,960 --> 00:44:53,560
in the Tianjin dialect?

1082
00:44:54,960 --> 00:44:55,640
Let him go first.

1083
00:44:55,640 --> 00:44:57,240
He's dying to try.

1084
00:44:57,480 --> 00:44:57,800
No.

1085
00:44:57,800 --> 00:44:59,680
I was just waiting for you to speak.

1086
00:44:59,960 --> 00:45:00,480
You two.

1087
00:45:00,480 --> 00:45:01,520
The two in the corner.

1088
00:45:01,600 --> 00:45:02,360
Yiheng.

1089
00:45:02,360 --> 00:45:03,440
She keeps bringing him up.

1090
00:45:04,240 --> 00:45:06,920
He's been pouring tea for us all day.

1091
00:45:06,920 --> 00:45:08,240
So thoughtful.

1092
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:10,280
Thanks.

1093
00:45:11,200 --> 00:45:12,320
Actually, I haven't

1094
00:45:12,320 --> 00:45:13,320
had cake in ages.

1095
00:45:13,320 --> 00:45:18,360
I only prepared one for you.

1096
00:45:19,080 --> 00:45:20,520
Let's go straight to the final round.

1097
00:45:20,520 --> 00:45:22,480
Our team's counting on Cao Yiheng.

1098
00:45:22,480 --> 00:45:23,960
You have a watch.

1099
00:45:23,960 --> 00:45:27,040
No touching!

1100
00:45:27,160 --> 00:45:29,200
She really enjoys listening to us chat.

1101
00:45:30,320 --> 00:45:31,120
She loves listening.

1102
00:45:31,120 --> 00:45:31,560
Really?

1103
00:45:31,560 --> 00:45:33,360
Really. Grab a chair and sit next to me.

1104
00:45:33,880 --> 00:45:35,160
Can she?

1105
00:45:35,160 --> 00:45:35,880
Sure.

1106
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:49,320
So little by little, I moved closer
to that warmth.

1107
00:45:50,760 --> 00:45:51,880
I want to cook for you every day

1108
00:45:51,880 --> 00:45:52,800
and eat with you.

1109
00:45:52,800 --> 00:45:55,840
I want to sit with you on the couch,
talking and doing nothing.

1110
00:45:56,520 --> 00:45:58,520
I want to make things with you.

1111
00:45:58,520 --> 00:46:00,640
I want to walk around campus with you.

1112
00:46:04,800 --> 00:46:06,840
I hope I can be there with you

1113
00:46:06,840 --> 00:46:08,240
for every important day ahead.

1114
00:46:08,920 --> 00:46:10,920
I want to keep inviting you

1115
00:46:10,920 --> 00:46:13,080
to make more memories with me.

1116
00:46:14,320 --> 00:46:15,360
I don't want to be someone

1117
00:46:15,360 --> 00:46:18,120
who only dares to say what I feel

1118
00:46:18,120 --> 00:46:19,240
through a text.

1119
00:46:22,400 --> 00:46:23,960
I want to turn everything left unsaid

1120
00:46:23,960 --> 00:46:26,120
into everyday moments with you.

1121
00:46:27,840 --> 00:46:28,880
I don't want to say I miss you

1122
00:46:28,880 --> 00:46:31,360
through a phone screen every night.

1123
00:46:33,720 --> 00:46:35,160
So now I'm sure of how I feel,

1124
00:46:35,160 --> 00:46:36,400
and I won't change my mind.

1125
00:46:36,800 --> 00:46:37,920
Would you

1126
00:46:37,920 --> 00:46:39,720
be my girlfriend

1127
00:46:39,720 --> 00:46:41,400
and step into the next chapter with me?

1128
00:46:41,400 --> 00:46:45,180
(Would you be my girlfriend and step
into the next chapter with me?)

1129
00:46:48,360 --> 00:46:50,040
(Would you be my girlfriend and step
into the next chapter with me?)

1130
00:46:50,040 --> 00:46:50,880
Yes.

1131
00:46:50,880 --> 00:46:54,140
(Yes)

1132
00:46:56,680 --> 00:46:57,920
Yes.

1133
00:46:57,920 --> 00:47:00,180
(Yes)

1134
00:47:00,640 --> 00:47:01,960
Yes.

1135
00:47:03,320 --> 00:47:04,040
Yes.

1136
00:47:06,120 --> 00:47:08,280
So happy.

1137
00:47:18,680 --> 00:47:19,720
Oh no!

1138
00:47:20,920 --> 00:47:22,600
I should've read mine first.

1139
00:47:24,880 --> 00:47:25,520
It's okay.

1140
00:47:25,520 --> 00:47:26,400
I...

1141
00:47:26,400 --> 00:47:28,230
(Pulls it out)
I actually have it right up my sleeve.

1142
00:47:28,800 --> 00:47:29,760
Oh no.

1143
00:47:30,360 --> 00:47:32,160
Did you prepare this for me?

1144
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:34,040
What is this?

1145
00:47:34,040 --> 00:47:35,800
It might be a little rough.

1146
00:47:36,120 --> 00:47:37,720
This is really rough.

1147
00:47:38,360 --> 00:47:39,640
I'll read it.

1148
00:47:43,680 --> 00:47:44,360
Oh no.

1149
00:47:45,760 --> 00:47:46,800
I'm done for.

1150
00:48:02,440 --> 00:48:03,060
It's okay.

1151
00:48:03,060 --> 00:48:05,220
(Comforts her)

1152
00:48:07,720 --> 00:48:09,640
To my sunflower, Yiheng.

1153
00:48:10,240 --> 00:48:11,280
On the phone just now,

1154
00:48:11,280 --> 00:48:12,440
I already told you

1155
00:48:12,440 --> 00:48:14,960
how I slowly fell for you.

1156
00:48:15,900 --> 00:48:17,140
(Chokes up)

1157
00:48:17,160 --> 00:48:18,600
Because I want you to know

1158
00:48:19,200 --> 00:48:21,040
